WEBVTT

00:03.000 --> 00:06.563
Building your creator page starts with a few simple details.

00:07.995 --> 00:14.818
Add your photo, creator name, bio, social links, and a personal page address that is easy to share.

00:16.231 --> 00:19.358
Next, create as many membership tiers as you need.

00:20.605 --> 00:28.246
Name each tier, explain the benefits, choose a monthly price starting at five dollars, and watch the fan preview update.

00:29.786 --> 00:33.681
You can also create discount codes and show a monthly support goal.

00:35.147 --> 00:38.826
Publish public posts or reserve content for paying members.

00:40.261 --> 00:48.675
Upload individual videos, bring over several original files at once, or import posts you already own through an RSS feed.

00:50.042 --> 00:59.204
Accept direct tips. Sell PDFs, audio, video, images, and ZIP bundles. Or stream live from your camera or screen.

01:00.492 --> 01:06.881
Connect Discord and Telegram. Community access updates automatically when memberships begin or end.

01:08.172 --> 01:15.477
Send subscriber updates. Offer text notifications for new posts. And keep every important link in one place.

01:16.684 --> 01:22.904
Track followers, paid member conversions, post views, and likes, so you can see what is connecting.

01:24.237 --> 01:30.246
Payments go directly to your connected Stripe account, with processing included and yearly reporting available.

01:31.587 --> 01:37.759
The Page Coach can guide your bio, tiers, posts, and launch, one question at a time.

01:38.545 --> 01:44.002
The first one hundred creators lock in the ten percent founding creator rate forever.

01:45.318 --> 01:51.045
Preview the finished page. Publish when everything looks right. Then share it with your audience.

01:51.798 --> 01:57.010
Your page is ready, with every tool you need to grow your community in one place.
